00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:49.000
and you know, who you are and what you stand for,

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:49.980
and the actions you take,

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.260
as opposed to just, you know,

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:53.340
uh, a label that you might have. So...

