But he can rock a v-neck better than anyone else.

00:35:16.480 --> 00:35:19.060
He can, yeah like he can do it though-- So why the hell not?

00:35:19.060 --> 00:35:20.560
If you got it, flaunt it baby.

00:35:20.560 --> 00:35:21.760
There you go. -There you go.

00:35:22.120 --> 00:35:24.120
Thanks for your question. Hi.

00:35:25.000 --> 00:35:27.560
Hi, uh, my question's for Tyler.

00:35:27.860 --> 00:35:28.960
Which one?

00:35:28.960 --> 00:35:29.600
Uh...

00:35:30.660 --> 00:35:31.660
Hey brotha!

00:35:31.660 --> 00:35:32.320
Hey!

00:35:32.800 --> 00:35:34.800
Being a, being a person of color,

00:35:34.820 --> 00:35:37.140
like especially a Hispanic person,

00:35:38.800 --> 00:35:41.780
like, how does it feel knowing that, like,

00:35:41.940 --> 00:35:46.740
you're kind of like a gateway for other actors that are of Hispanic descent,

00:35:46.800 --> 00:35:50.080
that, I mean like, you're a real inspiration to people of color,

00:35:50.080 --> 00:35:52.060
does it ever, like, bleed into your character?

00:35:52.880 --> 00:35:55.200
Uh, first of all I think, I think that's so cool,

00:35:55.240 --> 00:35:57.340
All I ever want to do is inspire people

00:35:57.420 --> 00:36:00.020
and, and, just inspire people to

00:36:00.020 --> 00:36:02.360
do more with their lives and do what they want to do.

00:36:02.360 --> 00:36:04.000
Um, so already

00:36:04.000 --> 00:36:06.220
that's, that's, i-i-it's one of the coolest things--

00:36:06.220 --> 00:36:08.480
I didn't, I didn't even really know that, uh,

00:36:08.740 --> 00:36:10.440
It just wasn't even in my head

00:36:10.440 --> 00:36:12.360
when I started doing "Teen Wolf" that I could inspire

00:36:12.360 --> 00:36:14.200
people of color to do,

00:36:14.200 --> 00:36:15.060
to do what I do.

00:36:15.320 --> 00:36:17.080
Um, and has it bled into my character?

00:36:17.080 --> 00:36:19.060
It hasn't really but I like it like that 'cause

00:36:19.060 --> 00:36:20.080
it's more natural, you know?

00:36:20.080 --> 00:36:22.240
It's not-- We don't touch upon it all the time--

00:36:22.240 --> 00:36:23.240
or at all, really.

00:36:23.840 --> 00:36:26.920
Do we? Is Scott McCall Mexican or not? What is he?

00:36:27.660 --> 00:36:30.800
Yes. His mom's maiden name is Delgado.

00:36:31.660 --> 00:36:33.660
It is-- Okay yeah so Scott is Mexican.

